sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant AG as Auth Gateway
    participant AC as Auth Controller
    participant AS as Auth Service
    participant RTR as RefreshToken Repo
    participant DB as Database

    U->>AG: POST /auth/logout/all
    AG->>AC: forward request
    AC->>AS: logoutAllSessions(userId)

    %% 1) Validate user session via current JWT
    AS->>RTR: findByUser(userId)
    RTR->>DB: SELECT refresh_tokens WHERE userId=? AND revokedAt IS NULL
    DB-->>RTR: list of active tokens
    RTR-->>AS: tokens[]

    alt tokens found
        AS->>RTR: revokeAll(userId)
        RTR->>DB: UPDATE refresh_tokens SET revokedAt=now() WHERE userId=?
        DB-->>RTR: ok
        RTR-->>AS: done
        AS-->>AC: 204 No Content
        AC-->>AG: 204
        AG-->>U: 204 All sessions revoked
    else none found
        AS-->>AC: 200 already logged out
        AC-->>AG: 200
        AG-->>U: 200 already logged out
    end
